---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact & Devis Gratuit Électricien Bruxelles" 
  description="Contactez Allo Électricien à Bruxelles. Devis gratuit sous 24h ou dépannage d'urgence 24h/24 et 7j/7 au 0465 67 34 62. Formulaire de contact direct."
>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="relative bg-navy overflow-hidden pt-12 pb-24 border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#4a4a8a 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 z-10">
      <span class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs mb-3 block">À Votre Écoute 7j/7</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">
        <span class="text-primary">Contactez</span>-nous
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Besoin d'un devis gratuit pour une rénovation ou d'un dépannage immédiat ? Nos équipes vous répondent sans délai.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="relative z-20 -mt-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-20">
    <div class="bg-navy rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row border border-white/10">
      <!-- Info panel -->
      <div class="md:w-5/12 bg-navy-light p-10 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-pattern opacity-10"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Nos Coordonnées</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Pour toute demande de devis, remplissez notre formulaire et nous vous recontacterons sous 24h. En cas d'urgence électrique, privilégiez toujours l'appel téléphonique direct.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-white">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="material-icons text-xl">phone</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Téléphone 24/7</p>
                <a href="tel:0465673462" class="font-bold hover:text-primary transition-colors text-base">0465 67 34 62</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-white">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="material-icons text-xl">email</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Email</p>
                <a href="mailto:contact@allo-electricien.be" class="font-bold hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">contact@allo-electricien.be</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-white">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="material-icons text-xl">location_on</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Adresse administrative</p>
                <p class="font-bold text-sm">Rue Froebel 3, 1000 Bruxelles</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 italic">Intervention sur site chez le client</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-white">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
                <span class="material-icons text-xl">schedule</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase font-semibold">Horaires</p>
                <p class="font-bold text-sm">Chantiers : Lun-Ven 8h-18h | Sam 9h-14h</p>
                <p class="text-primary text-xs font-bold">Dépannage d'urgence : 24h/24 & 7j/7</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 mt-10">
          <div class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 p-4 rounded-xl">
            <p class="text-primary text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">bolt</span>
              Pour une urgence, appelez le 0465 67 34 62 !
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Form -->
      <div class="md:w-7/12 p-8 md:p-10 bg-navy">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Demande de Devis Gratuit</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">Réponse rapide et devis sans engagement sous 24 à 48 heures.</p>
        
        <form 
          action="https://formspree.io/f/xblywzyj" 
          method="POST" 
          class="space-y-4"
        >
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="name">Nom complet *</label>
              <input 
                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm placeholder-gray-500" 
                id="name" 
                name="name" 
                required 
                placeholder="Jean Dupont" 
                type="text" 
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="phone">Numéro de téléphone *</label>
              <input 
                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm placeholder-gray-500" 
                id="phone" 
                name="phone" 
                required 
                placeholder="0465 00 00 00" 
                type="tel" 
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="email">Adresse email *</label>
              <input 
                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm placeholder-gray-500" 
                id="email" 
                name="email" 
                required 
                placeholder="votre@email.be" 
                type="email" 
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="commune">Commune / Ville *</label>
              <input 
                class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm placeholder-gray-500" 
                id="commune" 
                name="commune" 
                required 
                placeholder="Ex: Uccle, Ixelles..." 
                type="text" 
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="service">Type de prestation *</label>
            <select 
              class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm" 
              id="service" 
              name="service" 
              required
            >
              <option value="">Sélectionnez un service</option>
              <option value="depannage-urgent">Dépannage d'Urgence</option>
              <option value="mise-en-conformite-rgie">Mise en Conformité RGIE</option>
              <option value="tableau-electrique">Remplacement de Tableau Électrique</option>
              <option value="installation-renovation">Rénovation Électrique Complète</option>
              <option value="borne-recharge">Borne de Recharge Voiture Électrique</option>
              <option value="domotique">Domotique & Smart Home</option>
              <option value="autre">Autre demande</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 mb-1" for="message">Description de votre besoin</label>
            <textarea 
              class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-navy-light text-white px-4 py-3 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none text-sm placeholder-gray-500" 
              id="message" 
              name="message" 
              rows="4" 
              placeholder="Précisez votre demande (type de bien, date souhaitée, panne constatée)..."
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button 
            class="w-full bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-navy font-bold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 cursor-pointer text-base" 
            type="submit"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">send</span>
            <span>Envoyer ma demande de devis</span>
          </button>
        </form>

        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 text-center">
          Vos données sont transmises de manière sécurisée pour le traitement de votre demande de devis conformément à notre politique de confidentialité.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

</Layout>
